    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by students at the University of Silicon Valley as a school project, Virion is an isometric action roguelike with a strong emphasis on player expression through movement. It follows a virus called Nebula attempting to escape from the watchful gaze of the Mother Computer, who seeks to eradicate it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat against three enemy types <br>Ranged and melee combat<br>Procedural generation of levels featuring a variety of handcrafted rooms<br>Powerups that affect gameplay <br>NPCs that give backstory into the world of Virion </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
